DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
UID:6dfd7c6f347c4df39014208d85fbe98f@visitmorgancountyin.com
DESCRIPTION:Porch Time LLC\, a local independent media group\, and the Tre
 ad Trimmers Car Club invite you to help them pack the fairgrounds in their
  second annual attempt to host the world's largest Trunk or Treat event on
  October 24\, from 5 to 9 pm. This event will take place at the Morgan Cou
 nty Fairgrounds in the infield at the Grandstand. They'll be expecting mor
 e than 250 vehicles (it'll take 275 to make it a record!) that will be dec
 orated and ready to pass out candy! This event is a community fundraise
LOCATION:Morgan County Fairgrounds\, 1749 Hospital Drive\, Martinsville\, 
 IN
URL:https://www.visitmorgancountyin.com/event/2nd-annual-worlds-largest-tr
 unk-or-treat/11743/
